        "original_id": "e675e53e-0357-5921-9821-ee41bd97df03",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Francis Schaeffer\n- Organizations: Southwestern Baptist Theological Seminary\n- Roles: Presbyterian pastor\n- Concepts: Presuppositional apologetics, creation, the flood, scriptural authority, science and scripture\n- Documents: statement on creation and the flood\n\nFacts:\n- Francis Schaeffer was a Presbyterian pastor.\n- Francis Schaeffer was known for taking a more presuppositional approach to apologetics.\n- Francis Schaeffer was one of the signatories of a statement.\n- Southwestern Baptist Theological Seminary followed the statement.\n- The statement said that science cannot override scriptural statements on creation and the flood.",
